===============================================================================
14) SCALING BOTTLENECKS
===============================================================================

SQL:
- hot primary
- distributed joins
- 2PC lock contention
- shard rebalancing
- index bloat

NoSQL:
- bad partition key hotspot
- denormalized update fanout
- secondary index costs
- large document rewrites
- read repair overhead

Production example:
Celebrity Instagram user causes partition hotspot.

Solution:
fanout write + cache + shard by post_id

