15) INTERVIEW DECISION MAKING
===============================================================================

FAANG answer structure:

“If relationships, transactions, and strong invariants dominate,
I’ll start with SQL.

If scale-out, flexible schema, and predictable key-based access dominate,
I’ll choose NoSQL.

For mixed workloads, I’ll use polyglot persistence.”

This line sounds very senior.

