17) WHEN NOT TO USE EACH
===============================================================================

DON’T use SQL when:
- schema changes daily
- joins not needed
- write scale massive
- event stream only
- cache/session workload

DON’T use NoSQL when:
- money movement
- seat booking
- strict foreign keys
- complex OLTP joins
- financial reconciliation

